Experimental USA high logic rate; original 60 Hz remains the default.
src/game/gow_logic_rate.cpp (GPL-3.0).
GOW_EXPERIMENTAL_LOGIC_FPS=120|240 changes the normal frame wait and measured
simulation step. Movies, fixed steps and non-frame waits retain the original path.
High-rate presentation follows game flips; VBlank/audio clocks remain unchanged.
Invalid values use 60. No launcher default or regional registration changes.
Synthetic tests cover timestep math, fallbacks, scheduler yield/late frames and
presentation tokens; results/limits: docs/research/experimental-logic-rate.md.
Integration: fix-chore patch 73-experimental-logic-rate, regenerated on the PR 26 chain (same change, new context).

